<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9257" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνόνητος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνομό-ᾱτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unprofitable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισσὰ κἀνόνητα σώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					758
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦπολλὰ λέξας . . κἀνόνητ᾽ ἔπη</span>
			v.l. ib.<i><span class="en">
				1272
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. γάμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1501
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hel.</u>
				886
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. γίγνεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					9.40
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.248a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1095a9
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1334b40
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄργυρον εἰς ἀνόνατα ῥέοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cerc.
					4.4
				</span></i>
			:—neut. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνόνητα</span> is freq. in <i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i> as Adv., <i>in vain,</i> as <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hec.</u>
				766
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Alc.</u>
				412
			</span></i> (lyr.), al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνόνητα πονεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					486c
				</span></i>
			: regul.Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pall.
				</span></i>
			
			<i>inHp.</i><i><span class="en">
				2.147
			</span></i>D, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1501
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, ibid. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀγαθῶν ἀ. τινα ποιῆσαι</span>”
				<i>deprive of all benefit from . .,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.141
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				19.315
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.800d
			</span></i>, Nic.Dam.<i><span class="en">
				p.13D.
			</span></i></div>
